dure roll can't be skipped. Asking the Oracle or picking a GM choice while a roll was owed used to slip past it. A price that forces an Endure roll says so before you pick it. The founding vow's cash-in waits until the track can win. The old build offered Keep Your Troth at 2 of 10, and a miss there forsook the vow. The dice teach the rule. Each challenge die says whether it was beaten, and How to Play explains","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T20:42:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937270","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927450-1846018067931088","game_id":"steam-4927450","kind":"announcement","title":"The Isentroth demo is live for Steam Next Fest","summary":"The demo is out. Swear your oath, take the first steps into the Isenmarch, and find out how far it lets you go. What is in it The opening of a saga on the black-water frontier, narrated scene by scene by the Machine Game Master, who answers what you actually do. Dice that mean something. Rolls, harm, supply and momentum are kept by the game's own rules. The narrator cannot fudge a roll. A daily play allowance that resets each day, so everyone gets a turn at the table. Steam Next Fest runs Octobe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T18:46:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931088","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4927450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:23Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:22Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4927450":"2026-10-20T18:50:23Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4927450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-20T18:5